{"id":"0c35680c0004f5e2","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-formula.md","title":"有签名的一阶项与公式","display":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-formula","aliases":["20-df-formula"],"display":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"local-formalization","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§10.1 可计算语言和 Gödel 编码；本地语法展开","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-strings]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula — 有签名的一阶项与公式"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§10.1 可计算语言和 Gödel 编码；本地语法展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,R,\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(F,R,\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 与逻辑标签两两不交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span> 且变量标签互异。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F:F\\to\\omega\">\\(a_F:F\\to\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_R:R\\to\\omega\">\\(a_R:R\\to\\omega\\)</span> 的计算性通过下列固定代码解释；保留原有符号编码和有限语法树编码。构造子按标签区分、单射且像互不相交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr T\">\\(\\mathscr T\\)</span> 是这些标签上的全部有限有序语法树。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u,u_0,u_1,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(t,u,u_0,u_1,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v,w,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(v,w,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in F\">\\(f\\in F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in R\">\\(r\\in R\\)</span>。变量视为单节点语法树。各交集均在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathscr T)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathscr T)\\)</span> 内取值。FV、AV 与 Ren 的递归参数是有限语法树；替换递归按下述 sz 的自然数值进行。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\phi\">\\(\\neg\\phi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\to\\psi\">\\(\\phi\\to\\psi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\phi\">\\(\\forall v\\phi\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\">\\(t=u\\)</span> 分别表示原构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\neg,\\phi)\">\\((\\neg,\\phi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)\">\\((\\to,\\phi,\\psi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\forall,v,\\phi)\">\\((\\forall,v,\\phi)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(=,t,u)\">\\((=,t,u)\\)</span>。对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(v_i)_{i\\in E}^{\\uparrow}\">\\((v_i)_{i\\in E}^{\\uparrow}\\)</span> 按自然数升序列出。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec w\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec w\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。Ren 只在 z 不在待处理公式的 AV 中的替换分支用于改名；其一般递归本身仍是全定义的语法操作。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"755e421576224435\" href=\"?note=755e421576224435\" title=\"20-df-strings\">20-df-strings</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9885f96cf9cb2fff\" href=\"?note=9885f96cf9cb2fff\" title=\"20-df-finite-sequence-code\">20-df-finite-sequence-code</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Lambda=\\{\\neg,\\to,\\forall,=\\}\">\\(\\Lambda=\\{\\neg,\\to,\\forall,=\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\Lambda\">\\(\\Gamma=F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\Lambda\\)</span>。将原符号编码、原树编码分别记为固定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota:\\Gamma\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(\\iota:\\Gamma\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa:\\mathscr T\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(\\kappa:\\mathscr T\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>，不改变任何已有代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf N:\\Gamma\\times\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathscr T\">\\(\\mathsf N:\\Gamma\\times\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathscr T\\)</span> 只是既有有限有序树构造子的统一记法：根标签为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Gamma\">\\(a\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>，直接子树按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\xi\\in\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec\\xi\\in\\mathscr T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的次序排列。每棵树有唯一的这种根与子树分解，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf N(v,())=v,\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})=(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})=(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(=,(t,u))=(=,t,u),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\neg,(\\phi))=(\\neg,\\phi),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(\\to,(\\phi,\\psi))=(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\forall,(v,\\phi))=(\\forall,v,\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf N(v,())=v,\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})=(f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})=(r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(=,(t,u))=(=,t,u),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\neg,(\\phi))=(\\neg,\\phi),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(\\to,(\\phi,\\psi))=(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\forall,(v,\\phi))=(\\forall,v,\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>给定数值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathsf{root},\\mathsf{children}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\nu,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathsf{root},\\mathsf{children}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{build}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(\\mathsf{build}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span>。它们是同一原编码的变量编号、元数、析构和构造算法参数，满足以下条件；无须给不存在的语法对象赋予含义。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota[F],\\ \\iota[R],\\ \\iota[\\mathrm{Var}],\\ \\iota[\\Lambda],\\ \\kappa[\\mathscr T]\\in\\mathcal R,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [\\nu(i)=\\iota(v_i)],\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in F\\ [\\alpha_F(\\iota(f))=a_F(f)],\\qquad\n\\forall r\\in R\\ [\\alpha_R(\\iota(r))=a_R(r)],\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\ \\forall(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathscr T^m\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{build}\\bigl(\\iota(a),\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\\bigr)\n=\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})),\\\\\n\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))=\\iota(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{children}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))\n=\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota[F],\\ \\iota[R],\\ \\iota[\\mathrm{Var}],\\ \\iota[\\Lambda],\\ \\kappa[\\mathscr T]\\in\\mathcal R,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [\\nu(i)=\\iota(v_i)],\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in F\\ [\\alpha_F(\\iota(f))=a_F(f)],\\qquad\n\\forall r\\in R\\ [\\alpha_R(\\iota(r))=a_R(r)],\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\ \\forall(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathscr T^m\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{build}\\bigl(\\iota(a),\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\\bigr)\n=\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})),\\\\\n\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))=\\iota(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{children}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i&lt;m})))\n=\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i&lt;m})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些数值函数在全部自然数输入上全定义；上式只约束对应有效树数据的输入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{seqcode}\">\\(\\operatorname{seqcode}\\)</span> 仅用于传递有限子树代码列表，不替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 或任何程序编号。下游所谓语法操作可计算，均指在这同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 编码上计算；符号类别检查、根与子树分解、变量次序以及各构造子均由上述接口确定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{v\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L):=\\{\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\phi\\land\\psi:=(\\neg,(\\to,\\phi,(\\neg,\\psi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\lor\\psi:=(\\to,(\\neg,\\phi),\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists v\\phi:=(\\neg,(\\forall,v,(\\neg,\\phi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\qquad\n(t\\ne u):=\\neg(t=u).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\\bigcup_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{v\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L):=\\{\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\phi\\land\\psi:=(\\neg,(\\to,\\phi,(\\neg,\\psi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\lor\\psi:=(\\to,(\\neg,\\phi),\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists v\\phi:=(\\neg,(\\forall,v,(\\neg,\\phi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\qquad\n(t\\ne u):=\\neg(t=u).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{AV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((f,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{AV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((r,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\{v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}(E):=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin E\\}}\n\\quad(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var},\\ |E|&lt;\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\theta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\top\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\neg\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\forall w\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nv=w\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\lor\n(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{AV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((f,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{AV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((r,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\{v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}(E):=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin E\\}}\n\\quad(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var},\\ |E|&lt;\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\theta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\top\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\neg\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\forall w\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nv=w\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\lor\n(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{sz}(v):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}((=,t,u)):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(t)+\\operatorname{sz}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\neg\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi)+\\operatorname{sz}(\\psi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall v\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(v):=\\begin{cases}z&amp;v=w,\\\\v&amp;v\\ne w,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\n(f,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((=,t,u)):=\n(=,\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t),\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\n(r,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\neg\\phi):=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)\\to\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\forall v\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v\\phi&amp;v=w,\\\\\n\\forall v\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)&amp;v\\ne w,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}:\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\xi))=\\operatorname{sz}(\\xi)\n\\quad(\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi))&lt;\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall w\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{sz}(v):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}((=,t,u)):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(t)+\\operatorname{sz}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=1+\\sum_{i&lt;a_R(r)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\neg\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi)+\\operatorname{sz}(\\psi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall v\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(v):=\\begin{cases}z&amp;v=w,\\\\v&amp;v\\ne w,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((f,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_F(f)})):=\n(f,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((=,t,u)):=\n(=,\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t),\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((r,(t_i)_{i&lt;a_R(r)})):=\n(r,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i&lt;a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\neg\\phi):=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)\\to\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\forall v\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v\\phi&amp;v=w,\\\\\n\\forall v\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)&amp;v\\ne w,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}:\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\xi))=\\operatorname{sz}(\\xi)\n\\quad(\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi))&lt;\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall w\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nu[t/v]:=\\begin{cases}t&amp;u=v,\\\\u&amp;u\\ne v\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}),\\\\\n(f,(t_i))[t/v]:=(f,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\qquad\n(=,u_0,u_1)[t/v]:=(=,u_0[t/v],u_1[t/v]),\\\\\n(r,(t_i))[t/v]:=(r,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\quad\n(\\neg\\phi)[t/v]:=\\neg(\\phi[t/v]),\\quad\n(\\phi\\to\\psi)[t/v]:=\\phi[t/v]\\to\\psi[t/v],\\\\\nz(t,v,w,\\phi):=\\operatorname{Fresh}(\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{v,w\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall w\\phi)[t/v]:=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall w\\phi&amp;w=v\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\forall w(\\phi[t/v])&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z(t,v,w,\\phi)\\bigl((\\operatorname{Ren}_{z(t,v,w,\\phi),w}(\\phi))[t/v]\\bigr)\n&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t).\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}((),\\phi):=\\phi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{All}((v)^\\frown\\vec w,\\phi):=\\forall v\\operatorname{All}(\\vec w,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UC}(\\phi):=\\operatorname{All}((v_i)_{i\\in E_\\phi}^{\\uparrow},\\phi),\\qquad\nE_\\phi:=\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nu[t/v]:=\\begin{cases}t&amp;u=v,\\\\u&amp;u\\ne v\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}),\\\\\n(f,(t_i))[t/v]:=(f,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\qquad\n(=,u_0,u_1)[t/v]:=(=,u_0[t/v],u_1[t/v]),\\\\\n(r,(t_i))[t/v]:=(r,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\quad\n(\\neg\\phi)[t/v]:=\\neg(\\phi[t/v]),\\quad\n(\\phi\\to\\psi)[t/v]:=\\phi[t/v]\\to\\psi[t/v],\\\\\nz(t,v,w,\\phi):=\\operatorname{Fresh}(\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{v,w\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall w\\phi)[t/v]:=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall w\\phi&amp;w=v\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\forall w(\\phi[t/v])&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t),\\\\\n\\forall z(t,v,w,\\phi)\\bigl((\\operatorname{Ren}_{z(t,v,w,\\phi),w}(\\phi))[t/v]\\bigr)\n&amp;w\\ne v\\land v\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\land w\\in\\operatorname{FV}(t).\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{All}((),\\phi):=\\phi,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{All}((v)^\\frown\\vec w,\\phi):=\\forall v\\operatorname{All}(\\vec w,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{UC}(\\phi):=\\operatorname{All}((v_i)_{i\\in E_\\phi}^{\\uparrow},\\phi),\\qquad\nE_\\phi:=\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\in\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留所有原构造子、变量顺序、Fresh 选取规则和代入接口。原冲突分支先计算 φ[z/w]，再继续对结果代入；这不是单纯对“原树的真子树”递归。现在先用结构递归的 Ren 改名，再按显式大小 sz 递归。Ren 保持大小，故该调用严格小于原全称公式。</p>\n<p>在所选 z 不属于 AV(φ) 时，Ren 的结果逐字等于原 φ[z/w]；没有换成按 α 等价类取商，也没有更换新鲜变量的选择。</p>\n<p>来源：§10.1 可计算语言和 Gödel 编码；本地语法展开；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-strings]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-strings","status":"resolved","id":"755e421576224435","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-sequence-code","status":"resolved","id":"9885f96cf9cb2fff","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-strings]]；see [[20-df-computable]]；see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-finite-sequence-code]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(F,R,a_F,a_R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,R,\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a_F:F\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"a_R:R\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr T","display":false},{"tex":"t,u,u_0,u_1,t_i\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)","display":false},{"tex":"v,w,z\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathscr T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\to\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall v\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"t=u","display":false},{"tex":"(\\neg,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\to,\\phi,\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"(\\forall,v,\\phi)","display":false},{"tex":"(=,t,u)","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(v_i)_{i\\in E}^{\\uparrow}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec w\\in\\mathrm{Var}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Lambda=\\{\\neg,\\to,\\forall,=\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma=F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}\\cup\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota:\\Gamma\\hookrightarrow\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa:\\mathscr T\\hookrightarrow\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf N:\\Gamma\\times\\mathscr T^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathscr T","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec\\xi\\in\\mathscr T^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf N(v,())=v,\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})=(f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)}),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})=(r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(=,(t,u))=(=,t,u),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\neg,(\\phi))=(\\neg,\\phi),\\\\\n\\mathsf N(\\to,(\\phi,\\psi))=(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),\\qquad\n\\mathsf N(\\forall,(v,\\phi))=(\\forall,v,\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu,\\alpha_F,\\alpha_R,\\mathsf{root},\\mathsf{children}\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{build}\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\iota[F],\\ \\iota[R],\\ \\iota[\\mathrm{Var}],\\ \\iota[\\Lambda],\\ \\kappa[\\mathscr T]\\in\\mathcal R,\\\\\n\\forall i\\in\\omega\\ [\\nu(i)=\\iota(v_i)],\\qquad\n\\forall f\\in F\\ [\\alpha_F(\\iota(f))=a_F(f)],\\qquad\n\\forall r\\in R\\ [\\alpha_R(\\iota(r))=a_R(r)],\\\\\n\\forall m\\in\\omega\\ \\forall a\\in\\Gamma\\ \\forall(\\xi_i)_{i<m}\\in\\mathscr T^m\\\n\\left[\\begin{gathered}\n\\mathsf{build}\\bigl(\\iota(a),\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i<m})\\bigr)\n=\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i<m})),\\\\\n\\mathsf{root}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i<m})))=\\iota(a),\\\\\n\\mathsf{children}(\\kappa(\\mathsf N(a,(\\xi_i)_{i<m})))\n=\\operatorname{seqcode}((\\kappa(\\xi_i))_{i<m})\n\\end{gathered}\\right].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{seqcode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{T\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\mathrm{Var}\\subseteq T\\land\n\\forall f\\in F\\ \\forall(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)}\\in T^{a_F(f)}\\\n[(f,(t_i))\\in T]\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L):=\n\\{(=,t,u):t,u\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\}\n\\cup\\{(r,(t_i)):r\\in R,\\ (t_i)\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)^{a_R(r)}\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):=\\bigcap\\{S\\subseteq\\mathscr T:\n\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)\\subseteq S\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in S\\ \\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\\n[(\\neg,\\phi),(\\to,\\phi,\\psi),(\\forall,v,\\phi)\\in S]\\}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{FV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})):=\\bigcup_{i<a_F(f)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}((r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})):=\\bigcup_{i<a_R(r)}\\operatorname{FV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\setminus\\{v\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L):=\\{\\phi\\in\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)=\\varnothing\\},\\\\\n\\phi\\land\\psi:=(\\neg,(\\to,\\phi,(\\neg,\\psi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\lor\\psi:=(\\to,(\\neg,\\phi),\\psi),\\\\\n\\exists v\\phi:=(\\neg,(\\forall,v,(\\neg,\\phi))),\\qquad\n\\phi\\leftrightarrow\\psi:=(\\phi\\to\\psi)\\land(\\psi\\to\\phi),\\qquad\n(t\\ne u):=\\neg(t=u).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{AV}(v):=\\{v\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((f,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}((=,t,u)):=\\operatorname{AV}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(u),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}((r,(t_i))):=\\bigcup_i\\operatorname{AV}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\neg\\phi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\psi),\\quad\n\\operatorname{AV}(\\forall v\\phi):=\\{v\\}\\cup\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Fresh}(E):=v_{\\min\\{i\\in\\omega:v_i\\notin E\\}}\n\\quad(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Var},\\ |E|<\\omega),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\theta)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\top\n\\quad(\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Atom}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\neg\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi\\to\\psi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\forall w\\phi)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\nv=w\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi)\\lor\n(w\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\land\\operatorname{FreeFor}(t,v,\\phi)).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{sz}(v):=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})):=1+\\sum_{i<a_F(f)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}((=,t,u)):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(t)+\\operatorname{sz}(u),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}((r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})):=1+\\sum_{i<a_R(r)}\\operatorname{sz}(t_i),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\neg\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi)+\\operatorname{sz}(\\psi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall v\\phi):=1+\\operatorname{sz}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(v):=\\begin{cases}z&v=w,\\\\v&v\\ne w,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((f,(t_i)_{i<a_F(f)})):=\n(f,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i<a_F(f)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((=,t,u)):=\n(=,\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t),\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(u)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}((r,(t_i)_{i<a_R(r)})):=\n(r,(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(t_i))_{i<a_R(r)}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\neg\\phi):=\\neg\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi\\to\\psi):=\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)\\to\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\psi),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\forall v\\phi):=\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v\\phi&v=w,\\\\\n\\forall v\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi)&v\\ne w,\n\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}:\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)\\to\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\xi))=\\operatorname{sz}(\\xi)\n\\quad(\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Term}(\\mathcal L)\\cup\\operatorname{Form}(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{sz}(\\operatorname{Ren}_{z,w}(\\phi))<\\operatorname{sz}(\\forall w\\phi).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nu[t/v]:=\\begin{cases}t&u=v,\\\\u&u\\ne v\\end{cases}\\quad(u\\in\\mathrm{Var}),\\\\\n(f,(t_i))[t/v]:=(f,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\qquad\n(=,u_0,u_1)[t/v]:=(=,u_0[t/v],u_1[t/v]),\\\\\n(r,(t_i))[t/v]:=(r,(t_i[t/v])_i),\\quad\n(\\neg\\phi)[t/v]:=\\neg(\\phi[t/v]),\\quad\n(\\phi\\to\\psi)[t/v]:=\\phi[t/v]\\to\\psi[t/v],\\\\\nz(t,v,w,\\phi):=\\operatorname{Fresh}(\\operatorname{AV}(\\phi)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(t)\\cup\\{v,w\\}),\\\\\n(\\forall w\\phi)[t/v]:=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\forall w\\phi&w=v\\lor v\\notin\\operatorname{FV}(\\phi),\\\\\n\\forall w(\\phi[t/v])&w\\ne v\\land v\